<h3><u>Khabar</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Khabar</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Kisi Nay Aakay Madinay Mein Aam Ki Yeh Khabar</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>Safar Say Aatay Hain Ibn(a.s.)-e-Batool(s.a.) Laut Kay Ghar</p>
<p>Hain Saath Akbar(a.s.)-o-Abbas(a.s.) Qasim(a.s.)-o-Asghar(a.s.)</p>
<p>Sawaar Shaan Say Hain Bibiyan(s.a.) Bhi Oonton Par</p>
<p>Khushi Manaao Madinay Mein Aarahi Hai Bahar</p>
<p>(Watan Mein Laut Kay Aatay Hain Syed-e-Abrar) x2</p>
<ol><li>Gharon Ko Apnay Sajaao Hussain(a.s.) Aatay Hain</li><p>Sabilein Aaj Lagaao Hussain(a.s.) Aatay Hain</p><p>Charagh Ghar Mein Jalaao Hussain(a.s.) Aatay Hain</p><p>Khabar Yeh Sab Ko Sunaao Hussain(a.s.) Aatay Hain</p><p>(Woh(a.s.) Aarahay Hain Woh(a.s.) Tohfay Bhi Saath Laengay) x2</p><p>(Woh(a.s.) Sab Say Pehlay Mazaar-e-Nabi(s.a.w.w.) Peh Jaaengay) x3</p><li>Yeh Sun Kay Ghar Say Nikal Aey Mard-o-Zan Saaray</li><p>Keh Aarahay Hain Khuda Aur Rasool(s.a.w.w.) Kay Piyaray(a.s.)</p><p>Watan Mein Aatay Hain Zehra(s.a.) Ki Aankh Kay Taaray</p><p>Kitab-e-Haq Kay Madinay Mein Aatay Hain Paaray</p><p>(Saheliyon Nay Khabar Dee Yeh Jakay Sughra(s.a.) Ko) x2</p><p>(Chal Uth Kay Dekhlay Sughra(s.a.) Tu Apnay Baiyya(a.s.) Ko) x3</p><li>Pukarin Sughra(s.a.) Keh Din Eik Ka Naseeb Hua </li><p>Lo Meri Simt Bhi Mael Mera Tabeeb Hua</p><p>Khushi Ka Koi To Lamha Meray Qareeb Hua</p><p>Magar Yeh Saneha Sughra(s.a.) Peh Kia Ajeeb Hua</p><p>(Basheer Khaak Urha Kar Sada Yeh Deta Tha) x2</p><p>(Aray Hussain(a.s.) Maray Gaey Syeda(s.a.) Ka Ghar Ujrha) x3</p><li>Madinay Waalon Madinay Peh Chagai Hai Khizaan</li><p>Gharoon Mein Chain Say Baithay Huey Ho Aaj Kahan</p><p>Zamin Karti Hai Matam Falak Hai Mehw-e-Fughan</p><p>Rasool(s.a.w.w.) Giriya Kunan Fatima(s.a.) Hain Ashk Fishan</p><p>(Mahallah-e-Bani Hashim(a.s.) Mein Sog Taari Hai) x2</p><p>(Labon Peh Haaey Hussaina(a.s.) Ka Wird Jaari Hai) x3</p><li>Pukaarin Sughra(s.a.) Yeh Kis Tarha Aai Ho Amman(s.a.)</li><p>Kahan Hai Bhai(a.s.) Hamaray Kahan Hain BaBa Jan(a.s.)</p><p>Phophi(s.a.) Kay Shaanon Peh Kion Hai Rasan Kay Daagh Ayan</p><p>(Kahan Hai Asghar(a.s.)-e-Besheer Aur Sakina(s.a.) Kahan) x2</p><p>(Chacha Kay Hotay Huey Kis Tarha Yeh Haal Hua) x3</p><p>Shaheed Karbobala Mein Ali(a.s.) Ka Lal(a.s.) Hua</p><li>Zaeef Kon Hai Amman(s.a.) Jo Saath Chalta Hai</li><p>Kabhi Woh Girta Hai Girkar Kabhi Sambhalta Hai</p><p>Bataao Jald Kay Seena Say Dam Nikalta Hai</p><p>Mujhay Khabar Na Thi Keh Waqt Yoon Badalta Hai</p><p>(Nabi(s.a.w.w.) Kay Lal(a.s.) Ko Ummat Nay Qatl Kar Dala) x2</p><p>(Aray Qusoor Kia Tha Kay Mara Gaya Mera Kunba) x3</p><li>Pukarin Baano(s.a.) Yeh Boorhha Hai Syed-e-Sajjad(a.s.)</li><p>Hoi Hai Is(a.s.) Peh Bhi Baad-e-Hussain(a.s.) Woh Bedaad</p><p>Yeh(a.s.) Roraha Hai Unhin Manzaron Ko Kar Kay Yaad</p><p>Koi Nahin Tha Jo Sunta Gharib Ki Fariyad</p><p>(Dawa Kay Badlay Isay Tariyanay Lagtay Thay) x2</p><p>(Jo Neend Aati To Aada Jaganay Lagtay Thay) x3</p><li>Sinan Kalejay Peh Khakar Guzar Gaey Akbar(a.s.)</li></ol>

<p>Sitam Kay Teer Say Maaray Gaey Ali Asghar(a.s.)</p>
<p>Gulu-e-Sibt(a.s.)-e-Payambar(s.a.w.w.) Peh Chalgaya Khanjar</p>
<p>Phophi(s.a.) Kay Sar Say Utari Laeen Nay Chadar</p>
<p>(Shaheed Hogaey Abbas(a.s.) Hum(a.s.) Aseer Huey) x2</p>
<p>(Ameer Baap(a.s.) Kay Bachchay(a.s.) Sabhi Faqeer Huey) x3</p></font></p>
